 "title": "Perfect derived pairing",
 "statement": "In the Poincare duality conventions of this chapter, let\n$\\Lambda\\in\\{A,\\mathcal O_E,E,\\Qlb\\}$, and let $C,D$ be\nperfect point complexes\nover $\\Lambda$. A morphism\n\n$$\nb:C\\otimes _\\Lambda^LD\\longrightarrow \\Lambda\n$$\n\nis *perfect* if its tensor–internal-Hom adjoint\n\n$$\nD\\longrightarrow R\\operatorname {Hom}_\\Lambda(C,\\Lambda)=C^\\vee\n$$\n\nis an isomorphism.",
